{"kind":"request","text":"DX-T4 (recut): manifest and story builders, typed views and roles.\nReplaces 1e5a0594; amended by 4694a0ce item 6 after 1761d819. Child of\n99c4756a; carries the scenario harness request 736ca2bb, whose child\nDX-B2 3770c687 is retired into this item.\n\nType the two files beside a definition from the definition value, so\nthe manifest and the scenarios are checked in the editor and generated\nrather than copied.\n\nWanted:\n1. The manifest builder (the spike's package.ts): entry and\n   definitions from the path, host profile and capabilities, projection\n   field types and nullability from the slots, limits from many, states\n   and act lists in sorted order, connections from scope-typed\n   references; it checks that views name fields their source has and\n   that roles cover every grant, at compile time. The author still\n   gives which slots a projection shows, view layout, roles, assets and\n   the browser entry. The lending and Counter manifests regenerate byte\n   for byte.\n2. The story builder (the spike's story.ts): a story typed from the\n   definition, run on the real judges, writes scenario format v1:\n   expected is the item ids the also rules resolve, every step is\n   judged as written, the story is refused when the judge disagrees\n   with the author, projection rows are read from the fold. A story\n   fails when the act produced an entry, effect, send or timed firing\n   no step asserted. The JSON format stays and dap check accepts both;\n   the lending scenarios regenerate byte for byte and one is the\n   documented example under \"Write scenarios\".\n3. Views typed from the projection: acts, needs, facts and template\n   names checked in the editor; when goes through the DX-T2 tagged\n   template. Binding is unchanged.\n4. Roles declared first, and grant typed as the union of the declared\n   actions, so the package graph's ungranted-act is a compile error.\n5. Provenance: when a typed definition extends another, compile emits\n   the parent digest and the forms added, for the package to carry\n   later. Package parameters stay unbuilt (P5); no second mechanism.\n\nThe kernel is unchanged. No pinned bytes change.","body":{"conditions":"After DX-T3 lands. One gate, exact-head checker review, PD-2 note with the witness.","target_head":"06e4d33fe17937610891f29b5d1513b9e224edea","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}